        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="3685" ezremote:identifier="item_1_title" name="Item 1 title" type="ezstring">
          <text>Always up to date with the latest trends</text>
        </ezobject:attribute>
        <ezobject:attribute xmlns:ezremote="http://ez.no/ezobject" ezremote:id="3686" ezremote:identifier="item_1_description" name="Item 1 description" type="ezxmltext">
          <section xmlns:image="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/image/" xmlns:custom="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/custom/" xmlns:xhtml="http://ez.no/namespaces/ezpublish3/xhtml/">
            <paragraph>Bold Agency team has a deep understanding of the digital landscape and are always up to date with the latest trends and technologies. They are also very responsive and always willing to go the extra mile to help me achieve my goals. I would highly recommend Bold Agency to any fitness brand.</paragraph>
          </section>
